{
  "id": "nkBx9Xp80nE85sD7",
  "name": "PG - Reply Intake",
  "description": "Sandbox, manual. Reads synthetic inbound messages: STOP-type words set the contact to opted_out, any other reply sets replied; pending nudge drafts for that contact are cancelled; unknown senders are logged. Never sends.",
